=== WHAT WAS FIXED FROM PREVIOUS RUN ===
1. UNDER_SAMPLE_CAP=200 (was 500) -- actual under-sampling now happens
2. AUG_TARGET=1000 (was 500=cap) -- minority classes now get augmentation
3. WEIGHT_CLAMP_MAX=10 (was 100) -- Ampulla/Blood-hematin weights clamped
4. ReduceLROnPlateau added -- helps S2/S3 converge when loss plateaus
5. All 3 architectures trained (EffNetB0, MobileNetV3, ResNet50)
6. Full anomaly detection + GradCAM + false sample analysis added

Expected result: S3 F1(macro) > S2 > S1
If S3 Normal recall is still 0: reduce WEIGHT_CLAMP_MAX to 5
